message: "If you use CardioChrom, please cite the associated paper and archived software record."
title: "CardioChrom"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Huang"
    given-names: "Hongbiao"
version: "0.1.0rc2"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YMSWhuang/CardioChrom"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22239579"
    description: "CardioChrom Portable Frozen Model Bundle"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  A frozen cardiovascular virtual-epigenome inference framework that maps
  single-cell or single-nucleus RNA count profiles to reconstructed ATAC,
  H3K27ac, and H3K27me3 latent regulatory representations.
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - virtual epigenome
  - chromatin accessibility
  - cardiovascular genomics
